{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816720/extras/fb0ae1545673c3a336af42a10b706daa.avif?t=1766135052\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816720/extras_big/fb0ae1545673c3a336af42a10b706daa.avif?t=1766135052 width=800 height=352 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u300cGhost Deliverer\u300d</strong> is a Korean occult fantasy adventure game inspired by RPG Maker-style horror titles, featuring top-down pixel art graphics.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816720/extras/898dd0a0a23efde986ce423fbf94bce3.avif?t=1766135052\" width=1240 height=320 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816720/extras/ec86df19419c78f75b222f74bcf56387.poster.avif?t=1766135052\" width=1300 height=1300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816720/extras/ec86df19419c78f75b222f74bcf56387.webm?t=1766135052\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816720/extras/ec86df19419c78f75b222f74bcf56387.mp4?t=1766135052\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEA (Korean Exorcist Association)</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ghosts have threatened peace and safety of us since ancient times.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They commit evil deeds in places we can't see.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thus, <strong>KEA</strong>, a secret organization of psychics, protects us from evil spirits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816720/extras/03690a30ac566e4b68fc16c32e75c84c.avif?t=1766135052\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hye-seong, A Girl Who Sees Ghosts</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hye-seong has a psychic power inherited from her mother, a shaman.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She considers it a curse, because accidents happen to her constantly, including her mother's death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816720/extras/15959194af3e0e15f5594bd1437ca4fb.avif?t=1766135052\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After meeting <strong>KEA</strong> agents,<br>she realizes that mother's death was related to 'Lunacide', an organization of evil exorcists.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Will she be able to thwart their plot and find out the truth about mother's death?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816720/extras/657a4884d6d659f66bd9b48e9b7f5fcb.avif?t=1766135052\" width=1240 height=320 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816720/extras/90e2b75f02c5f1c75ec2b8c0af502d29.avif?t=1766135052\" width=1240 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816720/extras/36b4c50fead6c60f378f7b035fa3a50e.avif?t=1766135052\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The game consists of six chapters, from Chapter 0 to Chapter 5.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Early Access version, scheduled for release in late 2025,<br>will include Chapter 0 (DEMO), Chapter 1, and Chapter 2.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Subsequent updates\u2014Chapters 3, 4, and 5 (Full Release)\u2014are planned to<br>roll out sequentially starting from Q2 2026.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816720/extras/39dd16c48f36ff52e2c3b6f0c1f28ebe.avif?t=1766135052\" width=1240 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816720/extras/5bcbd0773fc7886023bc7b11753e3d2d.poster.avif?t=1766135052\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816720/extras/5bcbd0773fc7886023bc7b11753e3d2d.webm?t=1766135052\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816720/extras/5bcbd0773fc7886023bc7b11753e3d2d.mp4?t=1766135052\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game features two places:<br>A real world where people live ordinary lives and a \u2018Boundary\u2019 created by evil spirits with grudges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Although two worlds are clearly similar, there are differences between them.<br>Also, they are separate but closely connected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exorcise evil spirits hiding in the boundary and threatening<br>the safety of people in order to protect their precious daily lives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816720/extras/9073c76dd7d0cdc8dbf5ade8950341b0.avif?t=1766135052\" width=1240 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816720/extras/2f9cca55ea1da187cc5672698edbdc15.poster.avif?t=1766135052\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816720/extras/2f9cca55ea1da187cc5672698edbdc15.webm?t=1766135052\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816720/extras/2f9cca55ea1da187cc5672698edbdc15.mp4?t=1766135052\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816720/extras/57568483e228fa4a5b232e1b874fef68.poster.avif?t=1766135052\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816720/extras/57568483e228fa4a5b232e1b874fef68.webm?t=1766135052\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816720/extras/57568483e228fa4a5b232e1b874fef68.mp4?t=1766135052\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features a variety of distinctive puzzles inspired by everyday life,<br>Korean culture, and traditional folktales.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While some may appear complex at first glance,<br>they are designed with simple and intuitive mechanics\u2014such as spot-the-difference or riddles\u2014allowing global players with no prior knowledge to enjoy them effortlessly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816720/extras/854b1b9c5abb18005992b13c898b1e2b.avif?t=1766135052\" width=1240 height=128 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816720/extras/070ef9f182f84507786693ca5e0dd763.poster.avif?t=1766135052\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816720/extras/070ef9f182f84507786693ca5e0dd763.webm?t=1766135052\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816720/extras/070ef9f182f84507786693ca5e0dd763.mp4?t=1766135052\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout the game, players will encounter enemies and spirits that threaten the protagonist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From minor ghosts patrolling the map to vengeful spirits serving as chapter bosses,<br>players must explore various areas while evading them, experiencing the tension and thrill unique to horror games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816720/extras/d96738f9dba4f5984471e6c55355e10c.avif?t=1766135052\" width=1240 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816720/extras/64c41ce818a68010071e79cad4785897.poster.avif?t=1766135052\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816720/extras/64c41ce818a68010071e79cad4785897.webm?t=1766135052\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816720/extras/64c41ce818a68010071e79cad4785897.mp4?t=1766135052\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Incense serves as a medium that attracts wandering ghosts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By extinguishing incense placed throughout the map,<br>players can dispel these minor spirits and safely continue their investigation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816720/extras/cf1b0ba3f884d94d612439eca662e998.poster.avif?t=1766135052\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816720/extras/cf1b0ba3f884d94d612439eca662e998.webm?t=1766135052\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816720/extras/cf1b0ba3f884d94d612439eca662e998.mp4?t=1766135052\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additionally, relics imbued with the grudges and lingering regrets<br>of powerful vengeful spirits are hidden across the map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These cursed items contain the remnants of their malice, sorrow, and obsession from their mortal lives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the Boundary, understand the grudges and desires of demons,<br>and help them ascend to heaven by purifying their souls.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816720/extras/fa4f4cda16ed91de3ef5c10848be6a30.avif?t=1766135052\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816720/extras_big/fa4f4cda16ed91de3ef5c10848be6a30.avif?t=1766135052 width=800 height=216 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3816720?t=1766135052","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816720/50494cb77cebb4ea744a5104548ac286f0a63872/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766135052","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816720/b99d3a841ca4eaf63b795f2468166891dc288d1e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766135052","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816720/b99d3a841ca4eaf63b795f2468166891dc288d1e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766135052","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3839370,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Streaming Guidelines</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbLive streaming of the game Ghost Deliverer is freely permitted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbHowever, uploading recorded gameplay videos is only allowed for chapters excluding Chapter 5.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbIf the created content contains spoilers, please clearly indicate this in advance</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(e.g., endings, puzzle solutions, etc.).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbPlease ensure that spoilers are not included in the title or thumbnail of the content</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(e.g., ending images or scenes containing major plot twists).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbDo not upload content containing inappropriate expressions to platforms accessible to the general public.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbMonetization through game streaming is permitted; however, selling or conducting commercial activities involving secondary creations using the game\u2019s assets is strictly prohibited.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbFor any other inquiries, please contact us at <u><a href=\"mailto:teamdada0525@gmail.com\">teamdada0525@gmail.com</a></u>.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816720/extras/fb0ae1545673c3a336af42a10b706daa.avif?t=1766135052\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816720/extras_big/fb0ae1545673c3a336af42a10b706daa.avif?t=1766135052 width=800 height=352 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u300cGhost Deliverer\u300d</strong> is a Korean occult fantasy adventure game inspired by RPG Maker-style horror titles, featuring top-down pixel art graphics.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816720/extras/898dd0a0a23efde986ce423fbf94bce3.avif?t=1766135052\" width=1240 height=320 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816720/extras/ec86df19419c78f75b222f74bcf56387.poster.avif?t=1766135052\" width=1300 height=1300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816720/extras/ec86df19419c78f75b222f74bcf56387.webm?t=1766135052\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816720/extras/ec86df19419c78f75b222f74bcf56387.mp4?t=1766135052\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEA (Korean Exorcist Association)</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ghosts have threatened peace and safety of us since ancient times.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They commit evil deeds in places we can't see.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thus, <strong>KEA</strong>, a secret organization of psychics, protects us from evil spirits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816720/extras/03690a30ac566e4b68fc16c32e75c84c.avif?t=1766135052\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hye-seong, A Girl Who Sees Ghosts</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hye-seong has a psychic power inherited from her mother, a shaman.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She considers it a curse, because accidents happen to her constantly, including her mother's death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816720/extras/15959194af3e0e15f5594bd1437ca4fb.avif?t=1766135052\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After meeting <strong>KEA</strong> agents,<br>she realizes that mother's death was related to 'Lunacide', an organization of evil exorcists.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Will she be able to thwart their plot and find out the truth about mother's death?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816720/extras/657a4884d6d659f66bd9b48e9b7f5fcb.avif?t=1766135052\" width=1240 height=320 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816720/extras/90e2b75f02c5f1c75ec2b8c0af502d29.avif?t=1766135052\" width=1240 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816720/extras/36b4c50fead6c60f378f7b035fa3a50e.avif?t=1766135052\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The game consists of six chapters, from Chapter 0 to Chapter 5.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Early Access version, scheduled for release in late 2025,<br>will include Chapter 0 (DEMO), Chapter 1, and Chapter 2.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Subsequent updates\u2014Chapters 3, 4, and 5 (Full Release)\u2014are planned to<br>roll out sequentially starting from Q2 2026.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816720/extras/39dd16c48f36ff52e2c3b6f0c1f28ebe.avif?t=1766135052\" width=1240 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816720/extras/5bcbd0773fc7886023bc7b11753e3d2d.poster.avif?t=1766135052\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816720/extras/5bcbd0773fc7886023bc7b11753e3d2d.webm?t=1766135052\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816720/extras/5bcbd0773fc7886023bc7b11753e3d2d.mp4?t=1766135052\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game features two places:<br>A real world where people live ordinary lives and a \u2018Boundary\u2019 created by evil spirits with grudges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Although two worlds are clearly similar, there are differences between them.<br>Also, they are separate but closely connected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exorcise evil spirits hiding in the boundary and threatening<br>the safety of people in order to protect their precious daily lives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816720/extras/9073c76dd7d0cdc8dbf5ade8950341b0.avif?t=1766135052\" width=1240 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816720/extras/2f9cca55ea1da187cc5672698edbdc15.poster.avif?t=1766135052\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816720/extras/2f9cca55ea1da187cc5672698edbdc15.webm?t=1766135052\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816720/extras/2f9cca55ea1da187cc5672698edbdc15.mp4?t=1766135052\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816720/extras/57568483e228fa4a5b232e1b874fef68.poster.avif?t=1766135052\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816720/extras/57568483e228fa4a5b232e1b874fef68.webm?t=1766135052\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816720/extras/57568483e228fa4a5b232e1b874fef68.mp4?t=1766135052\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features a variety of distinctive puzzles inspired by everyday life,<br>Korean culture, and traditional folktales.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While some may appear complex at first glance,<br>they are designed with simple and intuitive mechanics\u2014such as spot-the-difference or riddles\u2014allowing global players with no prior knowledge to enjoy them effortlessly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816720/extras/854b1b9c5abb18005992b13c898b1e2b.avif?t=1766135052\" width=1240 height=128 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816720/extras/070ef9f182f84507786693ca5e0dd763.poster.avif?t=1766135052\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816720/extras/070ef9f182f84507786693ca5e0dd763.webm?t=1766135052\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816720/extras/070ef9f182f84507786693ca5e0dd763.mp4?t=1766135052\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout the game, players will encounter enemies and spirits that threaten the protagonist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From minor ghosts patrolling the map to vengeful spirits serving as chapter bosses,<br>players must explore various areas while evading them, experiencing the tension and thrill unique to horror games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816720/extras/d96738f9dba4f5984471e6c55355e10c.avif?t=1766135052\" width=1240 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816720/extras/64c41ce818a68010071e79cad4785897.poster.avif?t=1766135052\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816720/extras/64c41ce818a68010071e79cad4785897.webm?t=1766135052\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816720/extras/64c41ce818a68010071e79cad4785897.mp4?t=1766135052\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Incense serves as a medium that attracts wandering ghosts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By extinguishing incense placed throughout the map,<br>players can dispel these minor spirits and safely continue their investigation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816720/extras/cf1b0ba3f884d94d612439eca662e998.poster.avif?t=1766135052\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816720/extras/cf1b0ba3f884d94d612439eca662e998.webm?t=1766135052\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816720/extras/cf1b0ba3f884d94d612439eca662e998.mp4?t=1766135052\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additionally, relics imbued with the grudges and lingering regrets<br>of powerful vengeful spirits are hidden across the map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These cursed items contain the remnants of their malice, sorrow, and obsession from their mortal lives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the Boundary, understand the grudges and desires of demons,<br>and help them ascend to heaven by purifying their souls.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816720/extras/fa4f4cda16ed91de3ef5c10848be6a30.avif?t=1766135052\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816720/extras_big/fa4f4cda16ed91de3ef5c10848be6a30.avif?t=1766135052 width=800 height=216 /></span></p>","developers":["TEAMDADA"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816720/2ee202f6b98b2a1a8fc834baafac88acb32f0360/header.jpg?t=1766135052","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3816720/1093287232/dd51087b9e99da7d9988bb29afdc64784035a22f/1761401493/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761403897","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3816720/1093287232/dd51087b9e99da7d9988bb29afdc64784035a22f/1761401493/dash_h264.mpd?t=1761403897","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3816720/1093287232/dd51087b9e99da7d9988bb29afdc64784035a22f/1761401493/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1761403897","id":257176078,"name":"1st Official Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257176078/12602cd94e6f413997eca36efbe82c040c45425a/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1761403897"}],"name":"Ghost Deliverer",